     1,
     "<p>Hope the spring is treating you well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I&#39;m excited to do my workshop on sensitivity analysis\r\n(statistician&#39;s version) again this year with ICPSR.   Please\r\ncirculate widely.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ken</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b><a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/2hJP1gSBJYn-dMRD17B1dGdvcgCz29d3VXERAT3dTmFVJG7zonAF8cWSWoJ5tbOyVYO4nxhoUaIIGhikhWOgJRixV-4dpBOm9xL0We5BRZ1M6A4HlbWy0q40lcopKT2kxKwnE2_-s9NIE-gugJEeW5k4TgmOvzZwnBK68B7HXbfXqjFNdHFlkb--Oyw__;!!HXCxUKc!2Qzz3YzMloCNPF0oCY1ZmOtVlQ8jsGYZ4O-lg4-D-irlm2FhJu4zjqWwvF2sENiWo6rqrrU2l4iZ2sqcsrc$\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/2hJP1gSBJYn-dMRD17B1dGdvcgCz29d3VXERAT3dTmFVJG7zonAF8cWSWoJ5tbOyVYO4nxhoUaIIGhikhWOgJRixV-4dpBOm9xL0We5BRZ1M6A4HlbWy0q40lcopKT2kxKwnE2_-s9NIE-gugJEeW5k4TgmOvzZwnBK68B7HXbfXqjFNdHFlkb--Oyw__;!!HXCxUKc!2Qzz3YzMloCNPF0oCY1ZmOtVlQ8jsGYZ4O-lg4-D-irlm2FhJu4zjqWwvF2sENiWo6rqrrU2l4iZ2sqcsrc$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244399897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FowTR8G26svkN6v_hxcb0\">ICPSR</a>\r\ncourse July 13, 2026 – July 17, 2026, 10:00 AM-3:00 PMET, virtual format</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://web.cvent.com/event/4ea180c8-1f25-4314-8da9-145297b14113/websitePage:17e8f24b-550c-4a09-a091-06ccd6f667d5?session=271f87c0-e192-4e2b-b873-c793487483b8&amp;shareLink=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://web.cvent.com/event/4ea180c8-1f25-4314-8da9-145297b14113/websitePage:17e8f24b-550c-4a09-a091-06ccd6f667d5?session%3D271f87c0-e192-4e2b-b873-c793487483b8%26shareLink%3Dtrue&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244399897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1IDA6UOq4zqNd3b-zzSSef\"><b>Sensitivity\r\nAnalysis: Quantifying the Robustness of Inferences to Alternative Factors or\r\nData</b></a>.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12pt\">Most social scientists need to\r\nconsider the unobserved conditions that could change an inference. This\r\nworkshop is about the statistical tools (R, Stata or the <a href=\"https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244399897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bj2cWhpAthWx5LKteicK9\">konfound-it app</a>)\r\nto do just that, quantifying the strength of evidence to inform policy,\r\npractice, or general social science.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The course is 20 instruction hours -- half a semester&#39;s\r\nworth of instruction in just 5 days. That gives us time to tailor to specific\r\nexamples or approaches in your field. <br>\r\nRegister here. Group discounts available as well.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nICPSR Summer Program Home Page<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://myumi.ch/ICPSRSumProg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://myumi.ch/ICPSRSumProg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244399897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Ofn1nxXXdihiNfWQuMOe6\">https://myumi.ch/ICPSRSumProg</a><br>\r\nLink to Topical Workshops registration portal:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://myumi.ch/QqqX8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://myumi.ch/QqqX8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244399897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tZWsFpM21QibguT11A8tm\">https://myumi.ch/QqqX8</a><br>\r\nLink to a spreadsheet (read only) that has short URLs that point directly to\r\nthe Workshop&#39;s description on the registration portal:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bsNSdzxgedyY8ILCWgcqUMu_WKURJXuD9VMeRcZF6vc/edit?gid=0#gid=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bsNSdzxgedyY8ILCWgcqUMu_WKURJXuD9VMeRcZF6vc/edit?gid%3D0%23gid%3D0&amp;so